          "worked": "At the $x$-intercepts, $y=0$.\n$$\\begin{align*}0&=(x+\\sqrt{7})(x-\\sqrt{7})\\\\x+\\sqrt{7}&=0\\quad\\text{or}\\\\x-\\sqrt{7}&=0\\\\x&=-\\sqrt{7}\\quad\\text{or}\\quad x=\\sqrt{7}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
